    "title": "Ukraine Atlas: Living Ornament",
    "artDirection": "Petrykivka-inspired botanical rhythm, a golden bird player, cream paper and restrained green/red details. Distinct historical packs use verified period references.",
    "cultureNotes": "Avoid treating Petrykivka, pysanka, embroidery and Kosiv ceramics as interchangeable. This first pack explicitly cites Petrykivka; real museum photographs need provenance.",
